flowchart LR
  Auth[Viewer authentication and scope] --> Limit[Atomic read rate limit]
  Limit --> View[Bounded incident and snapshot read model]
  View --> Identity[Exact identity and time-window correlation]
  Identity --> Evidence[Incident / event / anomaly references]
  Evidence --> Rank[Deterministic hypothesis ranking]
  Catalog[Fixed internal runbook catalog] --> Rank
  Rank --> Output[Typed explanations with uncertainty]
  Output --> Human[Human investigation]
  Human --> Feedback[Operator feedback and audit]
  Human -. Separate authorization .-> Policy[Deterministic recovery policy and approvals]
  Policy --> Verify[Scoped operator and verification]
  Selector[Optional known-ID selector; API disabled] -. Fallback on error .-> Rank
